+## Ara-2 NPU
+- subplugin name: `ara2`
+- source: `tensor_filter_ara2.cc`
+- build option: `-Dara2-support=enabled`
+
+Sub-plugin for the Ara-2 NPU. Communicates with the NPU through a
+proxy daemon (dvproxy) over a Unix socket. Uses the V2 invoke API for
+DMA-BUF zero-copy support: when the upstream element delivers a DMA-BUF
+buffer, the data reaches the NPU without any CPU memory copy.
+
+**Custom properties** (passed via `custom=Key:Value,...`):
+- `SocketPath` – Unix socket path to dvproxy (default: `/var/run/proxy.sock`)
+- `Timeout` – Inference timeout in milliseconds (default: `5000`)
+- `EnableStats` – Enable periodic statistics logging (`true`/`false`, default: `false`)
+- `ZeroCopy` – Enable DMA-BUF zero-copy mode (`true`/`false`, default: `false`, see docs for limitations)
+
+**Basic usage:**
+```
+tensor_filter framework=ara2 model=model.dvm
+```
+
+**With custom properties:**
+```
+tensor_filter framework=ara2 model=model.dvm custom=SocketPath:/var/run/proxy.sock,Timeout:3000
+```
+
+See `Documentation/tensor_filter_ara2.md` for the full guide.
 
