+In ```GstTensorFilterFramework```, there are three API versions:
+- ```v0 (GST_TENSOR_FILTER_FRAMEWORK_V0)``` – legacy, kept for backward compatibility.
+- ```v1 (GST_TENSOR_FILTER_FRAMEWORK_V1)``` – recommended for most sub-plugins.
+- ```v2 (GST_TENSOR_FILTER_FRAMEWORK_V2)``` – for sub-plugins that need DMA-BUF zero-copy. V2 receives opaque ```GstMemory*``` pointers instead of pre-mapped buffers, allowing the sub-plugin to detect and handle DMA-BUF memory without a CPU mapping. See ```Documentation/tensor_filter_v2_api.md``` for the V2 guide.
 
+New sub-plugins should use ```v1``` unless DMA-BUF zero-copy is required, in which case use ```v2```.
 
